</section><h2>Expense history and running balance</h2><div id="dailySummary"></div><div id="expenseList" class="panel"></div></section><section id="bookings" class="page"><h2>🎟️ Bookings and stays</h2><p class="muted">Toggle booking status as you make reservations. Dates and times are your working itinerary and should be checked against tickets.</p><div class="panel"><h3>➕ Add a past or new booking</h3><p class="tiny">Enter tickets and rooms for your trip. The date below is the travel or stay date, not the payment date.</p><form id="bookingForm"><input id="bookingEditId" type="hidden"><label id="bookingDateLabel">Journey starting date</label><input id="bookingDate" type="date" required><label>Booking type</label><select id="bookingType"><option>Train</option><option>Accommodation</option><option>Flight</option><option>Bus</option><option>Taxi</option><option>Entry ticket</option><option>Other</option></select><div id="reservationModeMount"></div><div id="bookingSpecificFields" class="booking-fields"></div><label id="bookingNameLabel">Booking title / description</label><input id="bookingName" placeholder="Automatically generated for train bookings"><label>PNR / confirmation number (optional)</label><input id="bookingRef" placeholder="Ticket reference"><label id="bookingTimeLabel">Departure / event time (optional)</label><input id="bookingTime" type="time"><div id="accommodationTimes" hidden><p class="tiny">Accommodation: enter both check-in and check-out dates and times. These are saved with the booking and shown in the itinerary.</p><label for="bookingCheckoutDate">Check-out date</label><input id="bookingCheckoutDate" type="date"><label for="bookingCheckoutTime">Check-out time</label><input id="bookingCheckoutTime" type="time"></div><label>Ticket / fare paid (₹) — optional until payment</label><input id="bookingAmount" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="Leave blank if not yet paid"><label>Payment status</label><select id="bookingPayme